  "$id": "urn:lerna:architecture-2026-10-data1:core",
  "$comment": "Unpublished data1 design profile. Logical record and five command shapes; not DDL or a complete public API. Authentication, provenance, transitions, current eligibility, money and durable execution require separate checks. Fixture wrapper is not a wire frame.",
